### B. Functional Enhancements

#### B1. Automated Email Notifications
**File:** [mail.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/backend/src/modules/mail/mail.service.ts)

3 new branded HTML email templates:

| Template | Trigger | Recipient |
|----------|---------|-----------|
| `sendNewApplicationNotificationToHod()` | Applicant submits form | HOD's alternate email |
| `sendApplicationStatusNotification()` | HOD approves/rejects | Applicant's alternate email |
| `sendProvisioningNotification()` | CC Admin provisions | Applicant's alternate email |

**Integration:**
- [applications.module.ts](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/backend/src/modules/applications/applications.module.ts) — imports `MailModule`
- [applications.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/backend/src/modules/applications/applications.service.ts):
  - `create()` → calls `notifyHodOfNewApplication()` (non-blocking)
  - `updateHodStatus()` → calls `notifyApplicantOfStatusChange()` (non-blocking)
  - Private helper methods handle user lookups and error handling

> **Dev Mode:** In development, all emails log to console instead of sending. No SMTP credentials required for testing.

#### B2. Digital Signature Pad
**File:** [SignaturePad.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/frontend/src/components/SignaturePad.tsx) `[NEW]`

- Built with **native HTML Canvas API** — no external dependency needed!
- Touch-optimized for mobile/tablet + mouse support for desktop
- Features: draw, clear, capture as PNG File
- Responsive canvas width (auto-resizes to container)

**Integration:** [new/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/frontend/src/app/dashboard/applicant/new/page.tsx)
- Toggle switch: **Upload** | **Draw** for signature input
- Both modes produce the same `File` object for form submission
- Preview with re-draw option after capturing

